#: src/view.cpp:1385
msgid "Buffer Size"
msgstr "Tamaño do búfer"

#: src/view.cpp:1386
msgid ""
"Reduce buffer size if you experience sound delays. Might have more CPU "
"impact though. (not applied yet)"
